### Books API

### GET public Books

GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books

### GET Books by admin
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books/admin
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImhvbXVnQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3NDc4NTg4NSwiZXhwIjoxNzc0Nzg2Nzg1fQ.I2avoDJT6mIAmIUk33fr1OupJaQT3tXKm8NCNx-tDQU

